true surely we are not going to ask  people who fled bombs and bullets to lie  homeless on the streets of britain i  suspect mr speaker he has felt as  ashamed as i have to watch how this  government has closed the door to people  who need our help people have been he  shakes his head people have been turned  back at calais they've been left  freezing by the roadside with their  children we've had planes leaving  neighboring nato countries packed to the  rafters except those to london because  this government has turned people away  the british people who've come forward  have shown that we are a far better  country than their government but unless  he gets a plan together a real plan not  just a press release all he is  effectively announcing is plans to fail  the people of ukraine twice over  he said today that they have our total  admiration and they do but they need  more than that they need our total  support
 

